	 (176079114240,1004,'Which option shows the view from above this stack ','{"text": "<p>Which option shows the view from above this stack of discs?</p><p>从上方看这叠圆盘可以得到下面哪幅图？</p><p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_8df912ba.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_8df912ba.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 100%;\\"/></p>", "format": "html"}','single','[{"text": "<p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_536a1bcd.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_536a1bcd.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 50%;\\"/></p>", "label": "A", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_5cc94bc2.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_5cc94bc2.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 50%;\\"/></p>", "label": "B", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_9f5d1e68.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_9f5d1e68.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 50%;\\"/></p>", "label": "C", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_0283f214.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_0283f214.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 50%;\\"/></p>", "label": "D", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_9c7d82d1.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_9c7d82d1.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 50%;\\"/></p>", "label": "E", "format": "html"}]','A','{"text": "", "format": "html"}',1,2022,'null','2026-05-13 21:07:45','2026-05-13 18:32:51'),
	 (176079597568,1001,'Which of the following pictures will we see when w','{"text": "<p>Which of the following pictures will we see when we use the stamp shown?</p><p>使用图中的印章，可以印出哪种图案？</p><p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_f026e882.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_f026e882.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 100%;\\"/></p>", "format": "html"}','single','[{"text": "<p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_17161272.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_17161272.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 50%;\\"/></p>", "label": "A", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_93216291.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_93216291.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 50%;\\"/></p>", "label": "B", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_55767ace.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_55767ace.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 50%;\\"/></p>", "label": "C", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_93445646.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_93445646.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 50%;\\"/></p>", "label": "D", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_c89f5a24.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_c89f5a24.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 50%;\\"/></p>", "label": "E", "format": "html"}]','D','{"text": "", "format": "html"}',1,2022,'null','2026-05-13 21:09:43','2026-05-13 18:32:51'),
	 (176079884288,1003,'Katrin builds a path around each square using tile','{"text": "<p>Katrin builds a path around each square using tiles like the one shown. How many tiles does she use around a square with side 5?</p><p>Katrin 用如图所示的地砖<img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_f21556ac.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_f21556ac.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 46.00px;height: 33.77px;\\"/>在每个正方形周围铺了一条路。请问她在边长为 5 的正方形周围铺路用了多少块地砖？</p><p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_e3da9b97.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_e3da9b97.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 100%;\\"/></p>", "format": "html"}','single','[{"text": "<p>10</p>", "label": "A", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>11</p>", "label": "B", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>12</p>", "label": "C", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>14</p>", "label": "D", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>16</p>", "label": "E", "format": "html"}]','C','{"text": "", "format": "html"}',1,2022,'null','2026-05-13 21:10:53','2026-05-14 14:13:09'),
	 (176080412672,1002,'Ann has 4 stickers as shown. She sticks down the s','{"text": "<p>Ann has 4 stickers as shown. She sticks down the star after she sticks down the square. She sticks down the star before she sticks down the triangle. Which picture could she end up with?</p><p>Ann 有 4 张贴纸（如图所示）。她在贴完正方形之后贴了星形，在贴三角形之前先贴了星形。她最终可能会得到下面哪张图片？</p><p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_62dcd0c9.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_62dcd0c9.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 100%;\\"/></p>", "format": "html"}','single','[{"text": "<p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_047e32aa.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_047e32aa.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 50%;\\"/></p>", "label": "A", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_a67d263d.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_a67d263d.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 50%;\\"/></p>", "label": "B", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_53bc32b2.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_53bc32b2.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 50%;\\"/></p>", "label": "C", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_f3d6f6ce.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_f3d6f6ce.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 50%;\\"/></p>", "label": "D", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_58668fa5.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_58668fa5.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 50%;\\"/></p>", "label": "E", "format": "html"}]','E','{"text": "", "format": "html"}',1,2022,'null','2026-05-13 21:13:02','2026-05-13 18:32:51'),
	 (176080605184,1002,'The sum of the five numbers in each house is 20. S','{"text": "<p>The sum of the five numbers in each house is 20. Some numbers have been painted over. What number is hidden under the question mark?</p><p>每间房子上的五个数字之和都是 20，但有些数字被盖住了。请问问号处的数字是几？</p><p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_16ec65da.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_16ec65da.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 100%;\\"/></p>", "format": "html"}','single','[{"text": "<p>3</p>", "label": "A", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>4</p>", "label": "B", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>7</p>", "label": "C", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>9</p>", "label": "D", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>14</p>", "label": "E", "format": "html"}]','D','{"text": "", "format": "html"}',1,2022,'null','2026-05-13 21:13:49','2026-05-13 18:32:51'),
	 (176080736256,1001,'Some lawns are shown below. Which lawn is the smal','{"text": "<p>Some lawns are shown below. Which lawn is the smallest?</p><p>下面哪块草地最小？</p>", "format": "html"}','single','[{"text": "<p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_09fd1833.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_09fd1833.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 50%;\\"/></p>", "label": "A", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_78c7c7be.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_78c7c7be.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 50%;\\"/></p>", "label": "B", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_3322f6ad.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_3322f6ad.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 50%;\\"/></p>", "label": "C", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_33ab428a.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_33ab428a.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 50%;\\"/></p>", "label": "D", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_494a06cd.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_494a06cd.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 50%;\\"/></p>", "label": "E", "format": "html"}]','A','{"text": "", "format": "html"}',1,2022,'null','2026-05-13 21:14:21','2026-05-13 18:32:51'),
	 (176081510400,1004,'Each year, Maria received teddy bears for her birt','{"text": "<p>Each year, Maria received teddy bears for her birthday. For her first birthday she received 1 teddy bear. For her second birthday she received 2 teddy bears. For each subsequent birthday she received one teddy bear more than the previous year. How many teddy bears does Maria have in total when she is 6 years old?</p><p>每年Maria 都会收到泰迪熊作为生日礼物。她过第一个生日时，收到了1只泰迪熊。过第二个生日时，收到了2只泰迪熊。之后的每个生日，她都比上一年多收到一只泰迪熊。当Maria 6岁的时候，她总共有多少只泰迪熊？</p>", "format": "html"}','single','[{"text": "<p>19</p>", "label": "A", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>20</p>", "label": "B", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>21</p>", "label": "C", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>22</p>", "label": "D", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>23</p>", "label": "E", "format": "html"}]','C','{"text": "", "format": "html"}',1,2022,'null','2026-05-13 21:17:30','2026-05-13 18:32:51'),
	 (176082018304,1004,'Dino moves from the entrance to the exit by going ','{"text": "<p>Dino moves from the entrance to the exit by going through rooms. He can only go through each room once. Dino adds up the numbers as he passes through each room. What is the highest total Dino can make?</p><p>小恐龙要从入口进去穿过一些房间到达出口。每个房间只能经过一次。小恐龙在经过每个房间时会把该房间的数字加起来。请问它能得到的最大数字之和是多少？</p><p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_f9951081.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_f9951081.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 100%;\\"/></p>", "format": "html"}','single','[{"text": "<p>27</p>", "label": "A", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>29</p>", "label": "B", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>32</p>", "label": "C", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>34</p>", "label": "D", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>36</p>", "label": "E", "format": "html"}]','D','{"text": "", "format": "html"}',1,2022,'null','2026-05-13 21:19:34','2026-05-13 18:32:51'),
	 (176082395136,1002,'In the picture, each shape stands for a different ','{"text": "<p>In the picture, each shape stands for a different number. Which number should be written in place of the question mark?</p><p>如图所示，相同的图形代表相同的数，不同的图形代表不同的数。请问问号处应该填哪个数字？</p><p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_8b880351.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_8b880351.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 100%;\\"/></p>", "format": "html"}','single','[{"text": "<p>10</p>", "label": "A", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>12</p>", "label": "B", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>14</p>", "label": "C", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>16</p>", "label": "D", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>18</p>", "label": "E", "format": "html"}]','C','{"text": "", "format": "html"}',1,2022,'null','2026-05-13 21:21:06','2026-05-13 18:32:51'),
	 (176082698240,1002,'Three zebras take part in a contest. The winner is','{"text": "<p>Three zebras take part in a contest. The winner is the zebra with the most stripes. Runa has 15 stripes, Zara has 3 more than Runa. Runa has 5 fewer stripes than Biba. How many stripes does the winner have?</p><p>三只斑马参加比赛，获胜者是斑纹最多的斑马。Runa 有 15 条斑纹，Zara 比 Runa 多 3 条，Runa 比 Biba 少 5 条。请问获胜的斑马有多少条斑纹？</p>", "format": "html"}','single','[{"text": "<p>16</p>", "label": "A", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>18</p>", "label": "B", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>20</p>", "label": "C", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>21</p>", "label": "D", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>22</p>", "label": "E", "format": "html"}]','C','{"text": "", "format": "html"}',1,2022,'null','2026-05-13 21:22:20','2026-05-13 18:32:51');
INSERT INTO mathcoe_db.questions (id,topic_id,title,content,question_type,`options`,answer,explanation,difficulty_level,source_year,tags,created_at,updated_at) VALUES
	 (176082866176,1004,'Kangy''s car can only turn left. It can never turn ','{"text": "<p>Kangy''s car can only turn left. It can never turn right. Which of the following five routes can Kangy take?</p><p>Kangy 的车只能左转，不能右转。以下五条路线中，Kangy 可以走哪条？</p>", "format": "html"}','single','[{"text": "<p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_2da1c3cb.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_2da1c3cb.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 50%;\\"/></p>", "label": "A", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_f3036470.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_f3036470.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 50%;\\"/></p>", "label": "B", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_4177f918.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_4177f918.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 50%;\\"/></p>", "label": "C", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_69f90681.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_69f90681.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 50%;\\"/></p>", "label": "D", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_fbd7a5e2.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_fbd7a5e2.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 50%;\\"/></p>", "label": "E", "format": "html"}]','A','{"text": "", "format": "html"}',1,2022,'null','2026-05-13 21:23:01','2026-05-13 18:32:51'),
	 (176083185664,1001,'There are five numbered cards on the table as show','{"text": "<p>There are five numbered cards on the table as shown. You may swap two cards at each step. What is the smallest number of steps needed to put the cards into increasing order?</p><p>如图所示，桌上有五张编号的卡片。每次你可以交换两张卡片的位置。要将卡片按照从小到大的顺序排列，最少需要交换几次？</p><p><img src=\\"http://124.222.75.232:8000/api/v1/static/uploads/20260514_045f8093.png\\" alt=\\"20260514_045f8093.png\\" data-href=\\"\\" style=\\"width: 100%;\\"/></p>", "format": "html"}','single','[{"text": "<p>1</p>", "label": "A", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>2</p>", "label": "B", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>3</p>", "label": "C", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>4</p>", "label": "D", "format": "html"}, {"text": "<p>5</p>", "label": "E", "format": "html"}]','C','{"text": "", "format": "html"}',1,2022,'null','2026-05-13 21:24:19','2026-05-13 18:32:51');
